{
  "id": "intro_hina",
  "title": "自己紹介：星野 緋奈",
  "return": {
    "mode": "members"
  },
  "format": "v039_steps",
  "sourceFormat": "legacy_array",
  "steps": [
    {
      "bg": "images/assets/bgev/bg011.jpg",
      "bgMode": "replace",
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "【自己紹介】星野 緋奈",
      "clearStorySprites": true,
      "stepId": "st_0001"
    },
    {
      "bg": "images/assets/bgev/bg011.jpg",
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "（あ、いたいた、緋奈だ。）",
      "stepId": "st_0002"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "おーい？ひなー。",
      "stepId": "st_0003"
    },
    {
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "aa",
          "src": "images/assets/char/aa_hina/standing/aa_hina_expression_01.webp",
          "side": "center",
          "left": "50%",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ],
      "stepId": "st_0004"
    },
    {
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "aa",
          "src": "images/assets/char/aa_hina/standing/aa_hina_expression_03.webp",
          "side": "center",
          "left": "50%",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ],
      "speaker": "緋奈",
      "text": "おつかれさまです、店長！",
      "stepId": "st_0005"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "ちょっとカメラにむかってさ、自己紹介してみて。",
      "stepId": "st_0006"
    },
    {
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "aa",
          "src": "images/assets/char/aa_hina/standing/aa_hina_expression_15.webp",
          "side": "center",
          "left": "50%",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ],
      "speaker": "緋奈",
      "text": "なんですか？あやしいなぁ・・、まぁいいですけど。",
      "stepId": "st_0007"
    },
    {
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "aa",
          "src": "images/assets/char/aa_hina/standing/aa_hina_expression_02.webp",
          "side": "center",
          "left": "50%",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ],
      "speaker": "緋奈",
      "text": "改めまして、星野 緋奈（ほしの ひな）です。",
      "stepId": "st_0008"
    },
    {
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "aa",
          "src": "images/assets/char/aa_hina/standing/aa_hina_expression_03.webp",
          "side": "center",
          "left": "50%",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ],
      "speaker": "緋奈",
      "text": "年齢は22歳、血液型はB型！",
      "stepId": "st_0009"
    },
    {
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "aa",
          "src": "images/assets/char/aa_hina/standing/aa_hina_expression_15.webp",
          "side": "center",
          "left": "50%",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ],
      "speaker": "緋奈",
      "text": "……って血液型とか要ります？",
      "stepId": "st_0010"
    },
    {
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "aa",
          "src": "images/assets/char/aa_hina/standing/aa_hina_expression_02.webp",
          "side": "center",
          "left": "50%",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ],
      "speaker": "緋奈",
      "text": "でもまあ、自己紹介ってそういうもんですよね。",
      "stepId": "st_0011"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "緋奈",
      "text": "えーっと、誕生日は7月22日、かに座です。",
      "stepId": "st_0012"
    },
    {
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "aa",
          "src": "images/assets/char/aa_hina/standing/aa_hina_expression_15.webp",
          "side": "center",
          "left": "50%",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ],
      "speaker": "緋奈",
      "text": "夏生まれだけど、夏はそんなに得意じゃないんですよね〜。",
      "stepId": "st_0013"
    },
    {
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "aa",
          "src": "images/assets/char/aa_hina/standing/aa_hina_expression_03.webp",
          "side": "center",
          "left": "50%",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ],
      "speaker": "緋奈",
      "text": "暑いとアイスばっか食べちゃうし。",
      "stepId": "st_0014"
    },
    {
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "aa",
          "src": "images/assets/char/aa_hina/standing/aa_hina_expression_15.webp",
          "side": "center",
          "left": "50%",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ],
      "speaker": "緋奈",
      "text": "まあ太るとか言いながら、食べるんですけど。",
      "stepId": "st_0015"
    },
    {
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "aa",
          "src": "images/assets/char/aa_hina/standing/aa_hina_expression_02.webp",
          "side": "center",
          "left": "50%",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ],
      "speaker": "緋奈",
      "text": "身長は158センチ、普通でしょ？",
      "stepId": "st_0016"
    },
    {
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "aa",
          "src": "images/assets/char/aa_hina/standing/aa_hina_expression_12.webp",
          "side": "center",
          "left": "50%",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ],
      "speaker": "緋奈",
      "text": "でも胸は普通じゃないってよく言われます。",
      "stepId": "st_0017"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "緋奈",
      "text": "これ、あたしの武器ですから！……なんてね。",
      "stepId": "st_0018"
    },
    {
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "aa",
          "src": "images/assets/char/aa_hina/standing/aa_hina_expression_10.webp",
          "side": "center",
          "left": "50%",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ],
      "speaker": "緋奈",
      "text": "そこは触れないでください、恥ずかしいので。",
      "stepId": "st_0019"
    },
    {
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "aa",
          "src": "images/assets/char/aa_hina/standing/aa_hina_expression_03.webp",
          "side": "center",
          "left": "50%",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ],
      "speaker": "緋奈",
      "text": "趣味はゲームと食べ歩き！",
      "stepId": "st_0020"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "緋奈",
      "text": "最近は夜にラーメン食べてからスイーツ食べるのがブームです。",
      "stepId": "st_0021"
    },
    {
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "aa",
          "src": "images/assets/char/aa_hina/standing/aa_hina_expression_15.webp",
          "side": "center",
          "left": "50%",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ],
      "speaker": "緋奈",
      "text": "お財布と体型に悪いけど、幸せにはなれます。",
      "stepId": "st_0022"
    },
    {
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "aa",
          "src": "images/assets/char/aa_hina/standing/aa_hina_expression_02.webp",
          "side": "center",
          "left": "50%",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ],
      "speaker": "緋奈",
      "text": "特技っていうほどじゃないけど、",
      "stepId": "st_0023"
    },
    {
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "aa",
          "src": "images/assets/char/aa_hina/standing/aa_hina_expression_12.webp",
          "side": "center",
          "left": "50%",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ],
      "speaker": "緋奈",
      "text": "テレビとか映像関係は得意です。",
      "stepId": "st_0024"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "緋奈",
      "text": "新しいガジェットとか配線とか、けっこう詳しいんですよ？",
      "stepId": "st_0025"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "緋奈",
      "text": "意外と要領いいんです、あたし。",
      "stepId": "st_0026"
    },
    {
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "aa",
          "src": "images/assets/char/aa_hina/standing/aa_hina_expression_15.webp",
          "side": "center",
          "left": "50%",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ],
      "speaker": "緋奈",
      "text": "でも暗算は全然だめ。",
      "stepId": "st_0027"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "緋奈",
      "text": "この前もお釣り間違えて店長に助けてもらいました……。",
      "stepId": "st_0028"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "緋奈",
      "text": "ほんと数字は鬼門です。",
      "stepId": "st_0029"
    },
    {
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "aa",
          "src": "images/assets/char/aa_hina/standing/aa_hina_expression_03.webp",
          "side": "center",
          "left": "50%",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ],
      "speaker": "緋奈",
      "text": "好きな食べ物はカレー！",
      "stepId": "st_0030"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "緋奈",
      "text": "辛いのでも甘いのでも大好き。",
      "stepId": "st_0031"
    },
    {
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "aa",
          "src": "images/assets/char/aa_hina/standing/aa_hina_expression_05.webp",
          "side": "center",
          "left": "50%",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ],
      "speaker": "緋奈",
      "text": "嫌いなのはなす。",
      "stepId": "st_0032"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "緋奈",
      "text": "なすだけはどう頑張っても無理。",
      "stepId": "st_0033"
    },
    {
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "aa",
          "src": "images/assets/char/aa_hina/standing/aa_hina_expression_15.webp",
          "side": "center",
          "left": "50%",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ],
      "speaker": "緋奈",
      "text": "なす農家さん、ごめんなさい。",
      "stepId": "st_0034"
    },
    {
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "aa",
          "src": "images/assets/char/aa_hina/standing/aa_hina_expression_03.webp",
          "side": "center",
          "left": "50%",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ],
      "speaker": "緋奈",
      "text": "お酒も好きです。",
      "stepId": "st_0035"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "緋奈",
      "text": "果実酒とかカクテル系とか、甘いやつ。",
      "stepId": "st_0036"
    },
    {
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "aa",
          "src": "images/assets/char/aa_hina/standing/aa_hina_expression_11.webp",
          "side": "center",
          "left": "50%",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ],
      "speaker": "緋奈",
      "text": "店長、今度一緒に飲みに行きません？",
      "stepId": "st_0037"
    },
    {
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "aa",
          "src": "images/assets/char/aa_hina/standing/aa_hina_expression_13.webp",
          "side": "center",
          "left": "50%",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ],
      "speaker": "緋奈",
      "text": "あ、でもあんまり飲ませると絡み酒になるんで注意です。",
      "stepId": "st_0038"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "緋奈",
      "text": "絡まれても怒らないでくださいね。",
      "stepId": "st_0039"
    },
    {
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "aa",
          "src": "images/assets/char/aa_hina/standing/aa_hina_expression_03.webp",
          "side": "center",
          "left": "50%",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ],
      "speaker": "緋奈",
      "text": "呼び方はもちろん『店長』です。",
      "stepId": "st_0040"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "緋奈",
      "text": "藍ちゃん、翠さん、こがねちゃん、琥珀ちゃん……",
      "stepId": "st_0041"
    },
    {
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "aa",
          "src": "images/assets/char/aa_hina/standing/aa_hina_expression_02.webp",
          "side": "center",
          "left": "50%",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ],
      "speaker": "緋奈",
      "text": "みんな仲良くしてくれて嬉しいです。",
      "stepId": "st_0042"
    },
    {
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "aa",
          "src": "images/assets/char/aa_hina/standing/aa_hina_expression_15.webp",
          "side": "center",
          "left": "50%",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ],
      "speaker": "緋奈",
      "text": "でもたまに甘えすぎって怒られます。",
      "stepId": "st_0043"
    },
    {
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "aa",
          "src": "images/assets/char/aa_hina/standing/aa_hina_expression_03.webp",
          "side": "center",
          "left": "50%",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ],
      "speaker": "緋奈",
      "text": "だって情にもろいんですもん、あたし。",
      "stepId": "st_0044"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "緋奈",
      "text": "あ、あとギャップポイント！",
      "stepId": "st_0045"
    },
    {
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "aa",
          "src": "images/assets/char/aa_hina/standing/aa_hina_expression_12.webp",
          "side": "center",
          "left": "50%",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ],
      "speaker": "緋奈",
      "text": "こう見えて、意外と要領はいいです。",
      "stepId": "st_0046"
    },
    {
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "aa",
          "src": "images/assets/char/aa_hina/standing/aa_hina_expression_13.webp",
          "side": "center",
          "left": "50%",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ],
      "speaker": "緋奈",
      "text": "ちょっとした裏技とか抜け道とか、探すの得意なんで。",
      "stepId": "st_0047"
    },
    {
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "aa",
          "src": "images/assets/char/aa_hina/standing/aa_hina_expression_15.webp",
          "side": "center",
          "left": "50%",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ],
      "speaker": "緋奈",
      "text": "ただし真面目なとこでは怒られるので、そこは注意してます。",
      "stepId": "st_0048"
    },
    {
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "aa",
          "src": "images/assets/char/aa_hina/standing/aa_hina_expression_02.webp",
          "side": "center",
          "left": "50%",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ],
      "speaker": "緋奈",
      "text": "……こんな感じで、",
      "stepId": "st_0049"
    },
    {
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "aa",
          "src": "images/assets/char/aa_hina/standing/aa_hina_expression_03.webp",
          "side": "center",
          "left": "50%",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ],
      "speaker": "緋奈",
      "text": "天真爛漫オールラウンダー、星野 緋奈でした！",
      "stepId": "st_0050"
    },
    {
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "aa",
          "src": "images/assets/char/aa_hina/standing/aa_hina_expression_11.webp",
          "side": "center",
          "left": "50%",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ],
      "speaker": "緋奈",
      "text": "これからもいっぱい甘やかしてくれていいんですよ？",
      "stepId": "st_0051"
    },
    {
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "aa",
          "src": "images/assets/char/aa_hina/standing/aa_hina_expression_10.webp",
          "side": "center",
          "left": "50%",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ],
      "speaker": "緋奈",
      "text": "冗談ですけど、冗談じゃないかもですけど……えへへ。",
      "stepId": "st_0052"
    },
    {
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "aa",
          "src": "images/assets/char/aa_hina/standing/aa_hina_expression_03.webp",
          "side": "center",
          "left": "50%",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ],
      "speaker": "緋奈",
      "text": "改めて、よろしくお願いします、店長っ！",
      "stepId": "st_0053"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "（緋奈の自己紹介を思い出に登録しました）",
      "stepId": "st_0054"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "",
      "auto": true,
      "wait": 500,
      "stepId": "st_0055"
    }
  ],
  "type": "special"
}
